---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ContractLinks from '../components/ContractLinks.astro';
import StatusNotice from '../components/StatusNotice.astro';
import scoreboard from '../data/scoreboard.json';

const format = (value: number) => value.toLocaleString('en-US');
const stageEntries = (source: (typeof scoreboard.sources)[number]) =>
  Object.entries(source.stage_counts as Record<string, number>).sort(([a], [b]) =>
    a.localeCompare(b),
  );
---
<Site title="Corpus scoreboard" description="Per-case replay of the reference-renderer corpora — KaTeX, MathJax, JEuclid, WebKit MathML and lasem — through the Logifos pipeline. Refusals are observations, not silent gaps." page="scoreboard">
  <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="title">
    <p class="kicker">Scoreboard / reference corpora</p>
    <h1 id="title">Every adopted corpus,<br />replayed case by case.</h1>
    <p class="introduction">The pinned reference-renderer suites replay through the same parse → transform → write → roundtrip → layout → emit pipeline as the conformance manifest. Cases refuse typed: an honest capability gap, never a silent one.</p>
    <StatusNotice />
  </section>
  <section id="totals" aria-labelledby="totals-title">
    <h2 id="totals-title">Replay totals</h2>
    <p>{format(scoreboard.totals.pass + scoreboard.totals.refusal + scoreboard.totals.failure)} cases across {scoreboard.sources.length} corpora: {format(scoreboard.totals.pass)} pass, {format(scoreboard.totals.refusal)} typed refusals, {format(scoreboard.totals.failure)} failures. Zero failures means the harness is sound; refusals mark where rendering capability stops today.</p>
    <div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Corpus totals" tabindex="0">
      <table>
        <caption>Per-corpus replay outcomes at pinned revisions</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Corpus</th><th scope="col">Cases</th><th scope="col">Pass</th><th scope="col">Refusals</th><th scope="col">Failures</th><th scope="col">Pinned revision</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {scoreboard.sources.map((source) => (
            <tr data-corpus={source.id}>
              <th scope="row">{source.id}</th>
              <td>{format(source.total)}</td>
              <td>{format(source.counts.pass)}</td>
              <td>{format(source.counts.refusal)}</td>
              <td>{format(source.counts.failure)}</td>
              <td><code>{String(source.revision).slice(0, 12)}</code></td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="refusals" aria-labelledby="refusals-title">
    <h2 id="refusals-title">Where capability stops</h2>
    <p>The leading refusal categories per corpus name the next work item precisely — an unsupported element in the transform, a missing notation parser, or the font gate that layout requires.</p>
    <div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Refusal categories per corpus" tabindex="0">
      <table>
        <caption>Refusal and pass categories by stage</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Corpus</th><th scope="col">Stage:outcome:category</th><th scope="col">Cases</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {scoreboard.sources.map((source) => (
            stageEntries(source).map(([key, count]) => (
              <tr data-corpus={source.id}>
                <th scope="row">{source.id}</th>
                <td><code>{key}</code></td>
                <td>{format(count)}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
    <h2 id="method-title">How the scoreboard is produced</h2>
    <p>Fetch the pinned suites with <code>scripts/fetch-reference-corpus.sh</code> in the logifos-rs checkout, then replay with <code>cargo run -p logifos-corpus -- --reference</code>. Every case is flattened into the conformance manifest format and graded by the identical pipeline; the JSON snapshot this page renders is that run's deterministic output.</p>
    <p>Rendering layout requires a font: cases completing the full roundtrip stop at <code>layout/font_not_configured</code> until a pinned math font ships in the grading corpus. Their capability depth stays visible in the stage counts above.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/logifos/logifos-rs/tree/main/corpus/reference">Corpus pins and fetch script →</a></p>
  </section>
  <ContractLinks />
</Site>
